      "writtenOn": "2021-02-12T00:13:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Robin brings in a good point. If we start requiring retroactively that vendor extension values must follow a certain format (e.g. being namespaced) this can, and will lead to regressions in VTS that were previously passing.",
